@startuml AddOrderSequenceDiagram
title Baker adds an order: add n/... p/... d/... s/... f/... fi/...

actor Baker
participant "BakerCli" as Cli
participant "Parser" as Parser
participant "OrderList" as List
participant "Order" as Order

Baker -> Cli : add n/Alice Tan p/91234567 ...
Cli -> Parser : parseAdd(input)
activate Parser
note right of Parser
  All six fields required.
  Unknown / duplicate / empty
  fields and invalid date or
  size are rejected here, before
  any object is created.
end note
Parser --> Cli : AddOrderDetails
deactivate Parser
Cli -> List : generateOrderId()
List --> Cli : "O001"
Cli -> Order : new Order(O001, Customer, Cake, dueDate)
Cli -> List : add(order)
Cli --> Baker : Added order O001: Alice Tan ...
note right of Cli
  On invalid input Parser throws
  IllegalArgumentException; the CLI
  prints "Error: ..." and no order
  is added (list unchanged).
end note
@enduml
